  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (HEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There will be a monitoring, evaluation and learning component to the HEP programme to help partners to strengthen their MEAL capabilities and and articulate their value proposition. This will include developing results metrics tailored to their specific services and to design a MEAL approach for the overall programme.</narrative>
  </description>
